  "ID": "60103",
  "post_title": "El Foro Cívico de Debate trata en Suera sobre la acogida de inmigrantes",
  "post_date": "2015-11-23 12:04:10",
  "post_name": "el-foro-civico-de-debate-trata-en-suera-sobre-la-acogida-de-inmigrantes",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Política|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>(28 fotos) Este fin de semana, organizada por el Foro C&iacute;vico de Debate, se ha celebrado en el sal&oacute;n de plenos del Ayuntamiento de Suera, la jornada La acogida de inmigrantes, el reto de este tiempo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/IMG_2016.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Se han mostrado diferentes experiencias y se ha insistido en la necesidad de facilitar la integraci&oacute;n de las personas que vengan de fuera de Espa&ntilde;a, bien por razones pol&iacute;ticas, econ&oacute;micas, o incluso a consecuencia del cambio clim&aacute;tico, como ha indicado el secretario auton&oacute;mico de Igualdad, el vilarrealense Alberto Ib&aacute;&ntilde;ez.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/IMG_1984.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n han intervenido Flores Higueras, presidenta provincial de la Cruz Roja, Juan Manuel Aragon&eacute;s, director general de Caritas Diocesana, y dos representantes de ACNUR, la organizaci&oacute;n de Naciones Unidas para refugiados, y ACCEM, que trabaja en la provincia de Castell&oacute;n en la acogida de inmigrantes.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/IMG_1976.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>Bel&eacute;n Bachero, diputada a Corts por Comprom&iacute;s y alcaldesa de Vistabella, ha explicado la experiencia de su municipio en acogida de inmigrantes en un edificio municipal de viviendas. Uno de estos domicilios se destinar&aacute; a acoger a una familia refugiada siria.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/IMG_2007.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>La &uacute;ltima en intervenir ha sido Embarka Hamoudi, una mujer saharaui que estudia en el Master de la Paz de la UJI.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/IMG_2012.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha cerrado la jornada el alcalde de Suera, Jos&eacute; Pascual Mart&iacute; Garc&iacute;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1968.jpg\" alt=\"img_1968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1970.jpg\" alt=\"img_1970\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1971.jpg\" alt=\"img_1971\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1972.jpg\" alt=\"img_1972\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1973.jpg\" alt=\"img_1973\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1974.jpg\" alt=\"img_1974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1975.jpg\" alt=\"img_1975\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1976.jpg\" alt=\"img_1976\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1980.jpg\" alt=\"img_1980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1981.jpg\" alt=\"img_1981\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1983.jpg\" alt=\"img_1983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1984.jpg\" alt=\"img_1984\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1986.jpg\" alt=\"img_1986\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1990.jpg\" alt=\"img_1990\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1991.jpg\" alt=\"img_1991\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1992.jpg\" alt=\"img_1992\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1994.jpg\" alt=\"img_1994\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1996.jpg\" alt=\"img_1996\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_1998.jpg\" alt=\"img_1998\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_2000.jpg\" alt=\"img_2000\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaimmigracioforumcividebatsuera211115/img_2002.jpg\" alt=\"img_2002\" style=\"ma